{
  "dom_id": "step-156897",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Identifying Elements Belonging to a Residue Class",
  "problem": "Which of the following integers belong to the residue class $[5]_{8}?$\n\n- $-3$\n\n- $13$\n\n- $3$",
  "worked_solution": "The residue class $[5]_{8}$ consists of the elements that are congruent to $5$ modulo $8.$ So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[5]_{8} & ={x\\in Z\\,|\\,x≡5\\,(\\text{mod}\\,8)} \\\\  & ={x\\in Z\\,|\\,x=5+8k,\\,k\\in Z} \\\\  & ={5+8k\\,|\\,k\\in Z} \\\\  & ={…,\\,5-2\\cdot 8,\\,5-8,\\,5,\\,5+8,\\,5+2\\cdot 8,\\,…} \\\\  & ={…,-11,-3,5,13,21,…}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe see that $-3$ and $13$ belong to $[5]_{8},$ while $3$ does not.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only.\"",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-156897\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"156897\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"14600\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-156897\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-3\">Identifying Elements Belonging to a Residue Class</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"156897\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n             